# Costa do Sol cadastral load (2026-08-26): real employee PII (nome, CPF,
# RG, nascimento, telefone, e-mail) must never enter git history, even in a
# private repo. Only the schema/tooling/seed files (tracked explicitly)
# belong here — the actual 97-record cadastral SQL and login candidates
# live outside the repo and are applied via the governed data-load flow.
scripts/data/*cadastral-update*.sql
scripts/data/*-candidates-*.json
scripts/data/*student-candidates*.json
scripts/data/*FINAL*

